description:
Change a video studio started with `vidiq_video_studio_start`, and get it back as `vidiq_video_studio_get` returns it. One call can:
- choose the take a scene uses (sceneNumber with mcpJobId), when the user prefers an earlier take to the newest;
- start the scenes that could not start, for example after the user added credits (startPending);
- record the `vidiq_compose` job that put the scenes together (composedJobId);
- set or replace the voiceover the finished video carries (voiceoverJobId), or take it off again (removeVoiceover).

To change what a scene shows, or to get another take of it, call `vidiq_generate_video` with retakeJobId set to that scene's mcpJobId instead.

Cost: free. A scene started with startPending is charged as a vidiq_generate_video clip, quoted exactly at submit.
